  "h": 705.65625,
  "text": "Mobility problems in dogs can come from lots of different things - joint wear, weakness, nerve issues, past injuries, or just getting older. Without knowing exactly what's affecting your pup, I'd like to help you narrow it down a bit. Tell me a bit more: is it the back legs that are struggling, the front, or all of them? And is your dog limping, stiff, or more generally weak?"
 },
